{"seq":3,"slug":"logistics-performance-metrics","title":"大学物流管理 — 物流绩效指标","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/logistics-mgmt/logistics-fundamentals/logistics-performance-metrics","wordCount":1600,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学物流管理-物流绩效指标\">大学物流管理 — 物流绩效指标</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>&quot;无法衡量，就无法管理。&quot;物流绩效指标（KPI, Key Performance Indicator）是用来量化物流系统运行好坏的标尺。没有指标，管理者就只能凭感觉决策；有了指标，才能发现问题、设定目标、跟踪改进。物流绩效通常从三个维度衡量：<strong>成本</strong>（花了多少钱）、<strong>服务</strong>（客户满意度）和<strong>效率</strong>（资源利用率）。优秀的物流管理，是在这三者之间找到动态平衡。</p>\n<p>物流绩效指标的设计要遵循 SMART 原则——具体（Specific）、可衡量（Measurable）、可达成（Achievable）、相关（Relevant）、有时限（Time-bound）。一个好的指标应该能直接指导行动，而不是看上去很美却无从下手的&quot;虚荣指标&quot;。</p>\n<p>本课将介绍物流领域最常用的几类核心指标，包括成本类、时间类、质量类和资产利用类，并用真实的行业基准帮你建立&quot;多少算好&quot;的直觉。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"成本类指标\">成本类指标</h3><p>成本指标回答&quot;物流花了多少钱&quot;，是企业最关心的一类。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>计算方式</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>物流成本率</td>\n<td>物流总成本 / 销售额</td>\n<td>衡量物流的整体负担</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>单位订单物流成本</td>\n<td>物流总成本 / 订单数</td>\n<td>评估单笔订单的物流效率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运输成本占比</td>\n<td>运输成本 / 物流总成本</td>\n<td>通常占 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>40</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>∼</mo><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">40\\%\\sim60\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">40%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>行业基准：中国社会物流总费用与 GDP 的比率长期在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>14</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">14\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">14%</span></span></span></span></span> 左右（近年降至约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>14.2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">14.2\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">14.2%</span></span></span></span></span>），而发达国家普遍在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>8</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>∼</mo><mn>9</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">8\\%\\sim9\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9%</span></span></span></span></span>。这个差距说明中国物流降本仍有很大空间，也是&quot;物流是第三利润源泉&quot;的宏观写照。</p>\n<h3 id=\"时间类指标\">时间类指标</h3><p>时间指标回答&quot;快不快&quot;，在电商时代尤其关键。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>订单周期时间（Order Cycle Time）</strong>：从客户下单到收到货物的总时长。京东的&quot;当日达&quot;&quot;次日达&quot;就是在这个指标上做文章。</li>\n<li><strong>订单处理时间</strong>：仓库收到订单到完成出库的时间。</li>\n<li><strong>库存周转天数（DIO）</strong>：</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mtext>平均库存</mtext><mtext>销货成本</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>365</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">DIO = \\frac{平均库存}{销货成本} \\times 365</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">销货成本</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">平均库存</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">365</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>库存周转天数越短，说明资金占用效率越高。前面提过戴尔做到约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 天，而传统零售可能要 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>30</mn><mo>∼</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">30\\sim60</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span></span></span></span></span> 天。每缩短一天周转，就能释放一笔被库存占用的现金。</p>\n<h3 id=\"质量类指标\">质量类指标</h3><p>质量指标回答&quot;准不准、好不好&quot;。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>订单满足率（Fill Rate）</strong>：有货可发的订单比例，电商常以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>95</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>∼</mo><mn>99</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">95\\%\\sim99\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">95%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">99%</span></span></span></span></span> 为目标。</li>\n<li><strong>准时交付率（OTD, On-Time Delivery）</strong>：按承诺时间送达的订单占比。</li>\n<li><strong>订单准确率</strong>：发货品种、数量完全正确的订单占比。</li>\n<li><strong>货损货差率</strong>：运输/仓储中破损、丢失的比例。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一个被广泛使用的综合质量指标是<strong>完美订单率（Perfect Order Rate）</strong>。它要求一笔订单同时满足&quot;按时、足量、完好、单据无误&quot;四个条件：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>完美订单</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>准时</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>足量</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>完好</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mtext>单据正确</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_{完美订单} = R_{准时} \\times R_{足量} \\times R_{完好} \\times R_{单据正确}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">完美订单</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">准时</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">足量</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">完好</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">单据正确</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>注意这里是<strong>连乘</strong>！假设每个分项都达到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>95</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">95\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">95%</span></span></span></span></span>，看似很高，但完美订单率只有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>0.95</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>81.5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.95^4 \\approx 81.5\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.9</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">81.5%</span></span></span></span></span>。这个连乘效应揭示了一个深刻道理：任何一个环节的小瑕疵，都会被乘进最终的客户体验里。要达到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>95</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">95\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">95%</span></span></span></span></span> 的完美订单率，每个分项需要做到约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>98.7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">98.7\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">98.7%</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"资产利用类指标\">资产利用类指标</h3><p>这类指标回答&quot;资源用得够不够省&quot;。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>车辆满载率/装载率</strong>：实际装载量 / 额定容量。空驶和半载是运输浪费的主要来源。</li>\n<li><strong>仓库利用率</strong>：实际占用面积/容积 / 总可用面积/容积。</li>\n<li><strong>设备利用率</strong>：叉车、分拣机等的有效工作时间占比。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>提高满载率是降运费最直接的手段。如果一辆卡车的满载率从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60%</span></span></span></span></span> 提到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>80</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">80\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80%</span></span></span></span></span>，意味着同样的货量少跑车次，单位运输成本随之下降。这也是&quot;拼车&quot;&quot;共同配送&quot;等模式的经济学基础。</p>\n<h3 id=\"用指标驱动改进-一个闭环\">用指标驱动改进：一个闭环</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[设定目标值] --&gt; B[采集实际数据]&#10;    B --&gt; C[对比分析差距]&#10;    C --&gt; D[定位问题环节]&#10;    D --&gt; E[改进措施]&#10;    E --&gt; A\">graph LR\n    A[设定目标值] --&gt; B[采集实际数据]\n    B --&gt; C[对比分析差距]\n    C --&gt; D[定位问题环节]\n    D --&gt; E[改进措施]\n    E --&gt; A</pre><p>指标的价值不在于&quot;考核&quot;，而在于&quot;驱动改进&quot;。比如发现货损率偏高，就去追根源是包装问题、装卸粗暴还是运输颠簸；发现满载率低，就优化排线和拼货。指标是手段，持续改进才是目的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>如果一笔订单的准时率、足量率、完好率、单据正确率分别是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.97</mn><mtext>、</mtext><mn>0.98</mn><mtext>、</mtext><mn>0.99</mn><mtext>、</mtext><mn>0.96</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.97、0.98、0.99、0.96</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.97</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">、</span><span class=\"mord\">0.98</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">、</span><span class=\"mord\">0.99</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">、</span><span class=\"mord\">0.96</span></span></span></span></span>，计算它的完美订单率。这个结果对你有什么启发？</li>\n<li>某公司年销货成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3.65</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3.65</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.65</span></span></span></span></span> 亿元，平均库存 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3000</span></span></span></span></span> 万元，计算其库存周转天数。如果想把周转天数压缩到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">25</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">25</span></span></span></span></span> 天，平均库存应控制在多少？</li>\n<li>为什么提高车辆满载率能直接降低单位运输成本？空驶率高的根本原因可能有哪些（提示：去程满载、回程空车）？</li>\n<li>你认为对一家生鲜电商而言，最重要的三个物流 KPI 是什么？为什么？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>供应链运营参考模型（SCOR）——一套标准化的供应链绩效指标体系，值得了解</li>\n<li>中国物流与采购联合会每年发布的《全国物流运行情况通报》——看宏观物流成本数据</li>\n<li>《关键绩效指标 KPI 开发实施与应用》——理解 KPI 设计方法论</li>\n<li>研究京东、顺丰财报中披露的物流时效与成本数据，对照本课指标</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>本课介绍了物流绩效的四大类指标：成本类（物流成本率、库存周转天数）、时间类（订单周期、周转天数）、质量类（满足率、准时率、完美订单率）和资产利用类（满载率、仓库利用率）。要特别记住<strong>完美订单率的连乘效应</strong>——它提醒我们物流是个环环相扣的系统，任何短板都会被放大。指标的最终目的是驱动&quot;设定—测量—分析—改进&quot;的闭环。到此第一章告一段落，你已经建立了物流的系统观、成本观和绩效观。下一章我们将深入物流的&quot;蓄水池&quot;——仓储与库存管理。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学物流管理 — 物流绩效指标","id":"大学物流管理-物流绩效指标"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"成本类指标","id":"成本类指标"},{"level":3,"text":"时间类指标","id":"时间类指标"},{"level":3,"text":"质量类指标","id":"质量类指标"},{"level":3,"text":"资产利用类指标","id":"资产利用类指标"},{"level":3,"text":"用指标驱动改进：一个闭环","id":"用指标驱动改进-一个闭环"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学物流管理 — 物流系统与总成本","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/logistics-mgmt/logistics-fundamentals/logistics-system-and-cost"},"next":{"title":"大学物流管理 — 仓储规划与作业","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/logistics-mgmt/warehousing-inventory/warehouse-planning-operations"}}